# The effector: tracks 9 and 8 feed pitch and velocity offsets down to the listeners 4 and 0.
# Ref: docs/03-sequencer-core.md section 8; manual p.59-60.
seed 42
bpm 128
track 9 role feeder
track 8 role feeder
track 4 role listener
track 0 role listener
track 9 mch 5
track 8 mch 6
track 4 mch 7
track 0 mch 8
track 9 step 0 active 1
track 9 step 0 pit +3
track 9 step 0 vel -10
track 8 step 0 active 1
track 8 step 0 pit -1
track 8 step 0 vel +5
track 4 step all active 1
track 4 step all len 8
track 0 step 0 active 1
track 0 step 4 active 1
track 0 step 8 active 1
track 0 step 12 active 1
play
render 6 s buffer=64
stop
render 1 s buffer=64
expect event on
expect balance
